  "semanticAssertions": [
    "All result money18,2; labor exact rate4*quantity2 HALF_UP to cents; historical excess scale reported and blocked, never automatically rounded",
    "Weights numeric18,6 exactly parsed, at least one positive; allocation uses exact integer/fixed decimal math and largest remainder; UUID bytes break ties",
    "Each source expected version provided once and set exactly equals sourceCostRecordIds; lock and compare actual source version; selected measurement layer known and currency identical",
    "Do not infer economic event identity or payment priority; all cost/allocated shares remain not included; later operating slice owns inclusion and event dedup",
    "net/tax known: allocate both base layers independently by largest remainder then gross=sum; gross-only remains gross-only; unknown is never zero",
    "Complete replacement creates new basis/full result set, same frozen source set, predecessor basis/result links; new result for anchored project is targetId; removed projects have no active successor",
    "Ordinary E replacement/mutation cannot alter a source frozen by active allocation; requires a dedicated governed full source/basis replacement",
    "Source refs are typed by domain; internal system IDs parsed UUID only for actual UUID source domains; LABOR rate sourceId is not unique economic event identity",
    "Manual evidence actor derived only from authenticated session, never accepted from client; businessDate must be a real date; source evidence businessDate/version/project must match persisted facts",
    "confirmed cost must lock stage even without lockedBySnapshotId; no current stage/date guessing, fake execution interval or handover prerequisite for all presigning costs",
    "Stage/tax/allocation evidence snapshots immutable; hashes accompanied by full stored payload; prior frozen operating results never rewritten",
    "Tax pending amount>=0, false flag implies zero pending amount, deductibility pending implies pending flag; signed impact never implicitly added to costs",
    "All six business write/audit/evidence/auth flush operations borrow same CommonSession; only Root controls transaction lifecycle",
    "Masked GET projection security events join same outer transaction; no source frozen payload or labor person/rate exposed",
    "Projection operating-finance package; per-project authorization before projection; multi-project aggregate source totals only when all contributing projects authorized; otherwise masked and no partial result portrayed as full batch total",
    "Source/money/evidence free text is projected; raw removed response fields cannot remain as hidden aliases; server-owned actor/status/supersedes IDs cannot be injected",
    "Read arrays preserve all history; tie by immutable id when timestamps equal; legacy governance_schema_version0 labelled legacy-unverified",
    "Unknown commit outcome labelled unknown; successful trace only after actual acknowledged outer commit"
  ],
